rm":"2.2074","ios":"2.2074"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2025-10-18T19:33:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T19:33:00Z"}],"tags":["gameplay","modtober25"],"about":"# Cosmic Clones\n\nEver played a platformer and thought it was too easy? Well not anymore! \\\nThis mod adds clones of the player that kill you if you touch it. These clones follow with a delay, changeable in settings.\n\n**Support <cr>will only</c> be provided on GitHub or Codeberg. <co>I don't check comments in the Mod Comments mod!</c>**\n\n<cy>Click Between Steps/Frames may cause unexpected issues, beware!</c>\n\n## Styles\n\nThis mod comes with a few styles!\n\n- Cosmic Mario: Based on Super Mario Galaxy. This style doesn't follow the 2-color system others do, instead using the cosmic look from the original.\n- Cosmic Clone: Based on Super Mario Galaxy 2.\n- Badeline: Based on Celeste. This style has a red trail to match the original.\n- Hungry Luma: From Super Mario Galaxy. This is the 2026 April Fools joke as a setting, and is an image instead of coloring or shaders.\n- The Yellow One: From the [More Difficulties](mod:uproxide.more_difficulties) 2026 April Fools joke.\n- eri: Profile picture of [Erymanthus](https://codeberg.org/raydeeux). Originally started as a joke out of boredom but I kept it because of a coinflip.\n- Custom: You can choose your own colors for the icon.\n\nCustom sound effects and sprite clones are *planned*.\n\n## Credits\n\n- [Undefined](https://github.com/undefined06855/) - Big help with shaders\n- [Zilko](https://github.com/zilko/) - Help with some parts of clone movement and some other minor help\n- [Uproxide](https://github.com/uproxide) - The Yellow One.\n- [Erymanthus](https://codeberg.org/raydeeux) - Allowing me to add him as a style (it initially started as a joke lol)\n    - [CinnamoonPi](https://reddit.com/u/CinnamoonPi) - Artist for ery's pfp\n\n## Support me!\n\nSupporting me on [my Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/cw/km7dev) is much appreciated, though I don't really have any benefits to provide for supporting me.","changelog":"# 1.4.1-beta\n- <cg>Add an api for other mods to hide the clones</c>\n\n# 1.4.0-beta\n\n- <cg>Add eri (with permission from Erymanthus) ![(insert eri sprite here)](km7dev.cosmic_clones/eri.png?scale=0.075)</c>\n- <cg>Add Markiplier.</c>\n- <cj>Rewrite the clones trigger to use Object Collab instead of the janky way I had it before.</c>\n  - **Some other changes were made as a result of this:** \n  - <cg>You can now edit multiple clones triggers at once.</c>\n  - <cy>Redid the Edit Object popup for the clones trigger.</c>\n  - <cy>Vanilla features and other mods no longer treat this as a sequence trigger.</c>\n  - <cy>Fixed a visual bug when Trigger Visualizer was enabled.</c>\n  - <cr>The Cosmic Clones tab in the editor is now removed. (A whole tab for one trigger was a waste of space anyway.)</c>\n- <cy>Very slightly edited the appearance of the clones trigger (you will probably not notice the difference).</c>\n- <cy>Fixed a crash with some editor mods installed.</c>\n- <ca>Removed dependency on EditorTab API.</c>\n- <ca>Updated to Geode v5.8.2.</c>\n- <cg>Added a [patreon link](https://www.patreon.com/cw/km7dev) for the support button in the mod popup.</c>\n- <co>Removed code that prevented Herobrine from existing.</c>\n\n# 1.3.2-beta\n\n- <cy>Fix some bugs when Fine Outline is installed</c>\n- <cy>Move source to codeberg</c>\n\n# 1.3.1-beta.1\n\n## I remembered I have free will.\n\n- <cg>Add Hungry Luma as a customization option</c>\n- <cy>**The Yellow One.**</c>\n\n# 1.3.0-beta.5\n\n- <cr>Reverted april fools stuff</c>\n\n# 1.3.0-beta.4\n\n- <cy>Fix an editor crash</c>\n\n# 1.3.0-beta.3\n\n## - Hungry Luma\n\n# 1.3.0-beta.2\n\n- <cy>Fix a bug which broke no damage</c>\n    - technical explanation: i checked a bool setting as a float\n\n# 1.3.0-beta.1\n\n- <cy>Change how clones work internally</c>\n- <cg>Add a trigger for creators to spawn clones</c>\n- theres probably stuff i forgot ngl\n\n# 1.2.2\n\n- <cy>Reset a value that I forgot to change back from testing</c>\n\n# 1.2.1\n\n- <cy>Fix for MacOS</c>\n- <cg>Added an easter egg</c>\n\n# 1.2.0\n\n- <cg>Clones can now work in the editor (off by default)</c>\n- <cg>Add a button to the pause menu</c>\n- <cg>Readd the trail for the badeline style</c>\n- <cy>Fix some memory leaks</c>\n- <ca>Update to Geode v5 / GD 2.2081</c>\n- <ca>Removed dependency on Alpha's UI Pack</c>\n- <cy>Other internal changes and optimizations</c>\n\n# 1.1.2\n\n- <cy>Fix a few visual bugs</c>\n\n# 1.1.1\n\n- <cr>Temporarily(?) remove trail from badeline style, as it was broken in 1.1.0 along with crashing with force ghost trail</c>\n\n# 1.1.0\n\n- <cg>Allow multiple clone types (this will reset your previously selected config, sorry!)</c>\n- <cg>Add a toggle for sound effects</c>\n- <cy>Fix robot glow</c>\n\n# 1.0.5\n\n- <cy>Fix clones visually freezing when turning your device off</c>\n\n# 1.0.4\n\n- <cy>Fix incorrect icons showing up in dual</c>\n- <cy>Fix clones having jetpack in normal mode</c>\n- <cy>Fix clones disappearing after mirror portals</c>\n\n# 1.0.3\n\n- <cg>Add an option to disable clone damage</c>\n- <cy>Make normal mode clones toggleable</c>\n\n# 1.0.2\n\n- <cy>Fix some metadata issues</c>\n- <cy>Clean up some code</c>\n\n# 1.0.1\n\n- <cg>Add tags cause I forgot to before</c>\n\n# 1.0.0\n\n- <cg>Initial release of the mod</c>\n","created_at":"2025-10-18T19:52:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T17:22:52Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://codeberg.org/km7dev/cosmic-clones"}}